X-WR-CALNAME:Piccadilly disruption
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-10-28T04:30:00&endDate=2026-10-30T01:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nPICCADILLY LINE: Wednesday 28\, Thursday 29 and Friday 30 October\, no service between Cockfosters and Uxbridge. Trains continue to operate between Acton Town and Heathrow\, all terminals. Use the METROPOLITAN LINE between Rayners Lane and Uxbridge\, and ELIZABETH LINE services between Central London and Heathrow. Replacement bus services operate.
DTEND:20261030T012900Z
DTSTART:20261028T043000Z
SUMMARY:Piccadilly: Part Closure
UID:a3bed2bc-7422-4912-97be-c5622a90dd94@a3be.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-10-31T01:00:00&endDate=2026-11-02T01:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nPICCADILLY LINE: Saturday 31 October\, from 0100\, and all day Sunday 1 November\, including Friday and Saturday Night Tube\, no service on the entire line. Use ELIZABETH LINE services between Central London and Heathrow\, and METROPOLITAN LINE services between Rayners Lane and Uxbridge. Replacement bus services operate.
DTEND:20261102T012900Z
DTSTART:20261031T010000Z
SUMMARY:Piccadilly: Planned Closure
